[0m [1m[38;5;98mPODS[0m - every pod and container of the namespace, live usage against what it asked for.
   [1mHealth line[0m (every view): ready pods, restarts, OOM risk, OOMKilled, pods without a memory
               limit, CPU / memory against limits, degraded / rolling workloads, events of 15 min.
   Grouped by workload (Deployment / StatefulSet / ...): the workload line is the sum of its pods.
   [1mACTUAL[0m      CPU in millicores (1000m = 1 core) and memory in MiB, measured by metrics-server.
